r all protected member areas and the crucial content management system for 'News & Events'. This role requires a focus on authenticated user workflows and creating a simple, intuitive admin experience.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Protected & Admin UI Supervisor\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent R (2) is requesting approval for call ID <recruit-security-sup-1692> of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"To define the necessary IAM roles and policies for all services, ensuring a least-privilege security posture. This is a critical and complex part of order `infra-plan-1` that warrants a dedicated planning agent who can synthesize the requirements from the other components.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Security & Permissions Supervisor\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$$APPROVED$$$\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent R (2) is requesting approval for call ID <recruit-hosting-sup-1689-rev1> of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"To create a detailed plan for hosting the static frontend application on AWS S3 and distributing it via CloudFront, as per the Chief's directive `infra-plan-1`. This requires specialized focus on S3 bucket configuration, CloudFront distribution settings, and Origin Access Identity implementation.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Infrastructure & Hosting Supervisor\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"$$